{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高本彩花のブログを見ましたが私は彩のことも好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなメンバーにランキングはありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにメンバーの中で1番長い時間一緒にいる人は高本彩花です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違いないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに昨日も今日も彩とご飯を食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彩のことは妹みたいに大事に思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹なので多少のわがままも許せます。\nいつも可愛いなと思って見てます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりなちゃんのことは推しメンです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京子はイケメンです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4YJ5XGCXJDWF0PSEMMDT0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい写真も高本彩花。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はプライベートの彩を盗撮してブログに載せます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお "}],"source":"archive"}